1)We can fetch data from the table by using the SELECT keyword
2)To select all the columns use SELECT * FROM TABLENAME;
3)This would fetch every column and every row from the table
4)To get specific columns you can write the column names in place of *.
5)For example SELECT col1Name,col2Name FROM TABLENAME;
6)This fetches specific column names col1Name and col2Name.
7)Note that column name is case insensitive.